than they really are. A thought can become overwhelming, a worry can grow until it seems to fill the whole room, and something uncertain can begin to feel more powerful than everything we know to be true. But the Bible reminds us of something simple and important: &lt;strong&gt;what frightens us is not greater than the God who is with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>